  "description": [
    "NON_NEGOTIABLES rule 14: POST, POST, POST → exactly one journal entry, one document",
    "number, one audit record.",
    "",
    "Steps 1–3: the same voucher three times under one key → one entry, JV-2027-000001.",
    "Step 4: the same key with a different amount → IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, nothing posted.",
    "Step 5: IDENTICAL content under a NEW key → a second, legitimate voucher,",
    "JV-2027-000002. Idempotency is by key, never by content (journal-voucher.md §7).",
    "Steps 6–8: the same invoice three times under one key → one entry, one invoice number.",
    "Step 9: the same invoice under a new key → SOURCE_ALREADY_POSTED.",
    "",
    "Numbers issued, by hand: JV-2027-000001, JV-2027-000002, JE-2027-000001,",
